				\begin{document}$$\Big| \left(-{\log }_{10}\,{{{{{{{\rm{Activity}}}}}}}}\,({c}_{i})\right)-\left(-{\log }_{10}\,{{{{{{{\rm{Activity}}}}}}}}({c}_{j})\,\right)\Big| > 1,$$\end{document}−log10Activity(ci)−−log10Activity(cj)>1,where Activity (⋅) stands for the activity value measured in terms of Ki, Kd, IC50, EC50, or Potency in nM. Otherwise, it was defined as a non-AC pair.

